<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib, round and loin cuts steady to weak, while chuck cuts weak. Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings.-USDA</p>
